{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月20日，華為常務董事、產品投資評審委員會主任、終端BG董事長餘承東微博發言表示，「今天發佈會上，有幾句話講得不準確，要糾正一下。享界V8現在給大家用的是L2輔助駕駛，L3的硬件能力已具備，但還沒有開放。大家用輔助駕駛要專心開車、按要求握好方向盤。現在還是L2時代，大家一定要注意安全，開車不能睡覺。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587362.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.713004+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_hash":"99aaec2787f41ce9588582aa850695e3ca578a1b07479a4f6525ce25c0f344f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}